@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Returned Report Review

DEVELOPER OWNER: UNASSIGNED — Team assignment required
MODULE: Sourcing Officer / Reports
TRELLO TASK: None — no dedicated Trello card
TRELLO URL: —

PURPOSE:
Show reports returned by the Manager and prepare the
corrected new version.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Sourcing Officer

ROUTE: /SourcingOfficer/Reports/Returned/{id?}

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Query TenderReports with Status = Returned for the
  Officer’s tenders.
- Create the corrected version; if scores must change, the
  committee needs a new round instead.

DEPENDENCIES:
TenderReports, Notifications, AuditLogs.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
Required report lifecycle step (spec §4.4, §4.6, §11); no
Trello card covers it — team assignment required.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Returned Report Review";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "Reports";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Reports the Sourcing Manager returned to you, with the reason, and the new version you prepare.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-returned-reports">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-returned-reports">Returned reports</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Tender</th><th scope="col">Report</th><th scope="col">Version</th><th scope="col">Returned by</th><th scope="col">Reason</th><th scope="col">Returned at</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="6"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No returned reports."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Prepare corrected version</h2>
    <form class="pg-form">
        <fieldset disabled>
            <div class="pg-form-grid">
                <div class="pg-field pg-field-wide"><label for="f-correction-notes-1">Correction notes</label><textarea id="f-correction-notes-1" rows="4"></textarea></div>
                <div class="pg-field pg-field-wide"><label for="f-corrected-content-2">Corrected content</label><textarea id="f-corrected-content-2" rows="4"></textarea></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pg-actions"><button type="submit" class="pg-btn pg-btn-primary">Submit new version</button><button type="button" class="pg-btn">Save draft</button><span class="pg-hint">Not implemented yet — nothing is saved.</span></div>
        </fieldset>
    </form>
</section>

<aside class="pg-note"><strong>Versions</strong><p>A submitted version is never edited. A correction is a new TenderReport row (VersionNumber + 1, PreviousReportId = the returned version).</p></aside>

<nav class="pg-links" aria-label="Related pages">
    <ul>
        <li><a asp-area="SourcingOfficer" asp-controller="Reports" asp-action="History">Report versions</a></li>
    </ul>
</nav>
